  "comment": "Local copy of the ANARI registry extension, trimmed to the parameters anari-cycles actually reads. Parameters removed here are unimplemented; they will be restored when the corresponding feature tasks land. Keep info.name equal to the official extension name so introspection still advertises it. 'radius' is a device addition (not in the KHR_GEOMETRY_CONE registry): the fallback radius used when 'vertex.radius' is absent, matching the helide reference device."
